# Icons & illustrations

## Icons

Use **[Lucide](https://lucide.dev/icons/)** only (`lucide-react` in the frontend).

- Prefer existing imports already used in the codebase.
- Match size/stroke to nearby icons (`h-4 w-4`, `h-5 w-5`, etc.).
- Do not introduce other icon packs (Font Awesome, Heroicons, Material, etc.) unless the user explicitly asks.

## Illustrations

When the user asks to **add illustrations**, use **[Storyset — Pana](https://storyset.com/pana)** style.

- Prefer Pana illustrations that fit empty states, onboarding, success/error, or marketing-adjacent in-app moments.
- Download/export SVG (or PNG if SVG is unavailable) and store under a clear assets path (e.g. `frontend/src/assets/illustrations/`).
- Attribute/credit Storyset if their license requires it for the chosen asset.
- Do not invent heavy custom illustration art when a Storyset Pana asset will do.
- Do not default to stock photo collages or other illustration libraries unless the user specifies otherwise.
